<p>Instantly consume what remains of your victim, healing yourself for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">366, 479, 567, 641, 707</acronym> life and generating <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">28, 32, 35, 37, 40</acronym> insanity.</p><p>Activating this will reset the cooldown of your Digest talent.</p><p>The life healed will increase with your Spellpower.</p>